g=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8075-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8399.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8399-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9636.jpeg\" data-size=\"3088x2316\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9636-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9423.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9423-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>",
